+-- api_ambush.lua -- the global Ambush, and RoomDescriptor.Data written (worker "ambush", 2026-11-19).
+-- Written against REPENTOGON's behaviour (LuaAmbush.cpp, Ambush.zhl); every number below was measured in THIS
